SUMMARY:Art Lounge:  Collage Night
DESCRIPTION:Pull up a chair\, get a cup of tea\, and make something beautiful! \nArt Lounge is your laid-back Thursday night creative escape — no agenda\, no pressure\, no experience needed. Just good music\, great company\, and a table full of materials waiting to become something entirely your own. Cut\, tear\, layer\, and arrange your way through the evening at whatever pace feels right. \nNot sure where to start? We’ve got prompts to spark your imagination and get the ideas flowing. Or ignore them completely and follow your instincts – either way works perfectly here. \nBring your friends\, bring your BYOB\, and leave with a piece of art you actually made. It’s the best kind of Thursday night. \n🗓 Thursday\, August 13 | 7:00 pm – 8:30 pm\n📍 The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, 2nd Floor\, Montclair\, NJ\n🎟 $10 | All materials provided | BYOB welcome \nOpen to everyone. No art experience needed. Just show up and create.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/art-lounge-collage-night/
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/20250111_144909-1-e1785383591898.jpg
END:VEVENT
